Tobias Dürschmid expressly reserves the use of the content of this repository
for text and data mining, including training or fine-tuning AI models,
pursuant to Article 4(3) of Directive (EU) 2019/790. Any such use requires
prior written permission.

The reservation covers the original content of this repository and of the
website built from it, https://tobiasduerschmid.github.io: book chapters,
tutorials, quizzes, flashcards and the other data under _data/, blog posts,
code, diagrams, and images. Third-party components keep their own licenses,
for example the libraries under js/vendor/, the js/ArchUML submodule,
Bootstrap, and the Datafolio site template this site started from.

This file grants no license. Copyright law and GitHub's Terms of Service
govern every other use of this repository's content.

The website states the same reservation in machine-readable form: in each
page's <meta> tags (W3C TDM Reservation Protocol), in /.well-known/tdmrep.json,
and in /robots.txt.
